::narrative: arc1_awakening_atoll
@title: Arc 1 - Awakening Atoll
::scene: arrival
@title: Arrival At Rust Reef
!sfx: anchor_drop, steam_release
!music: motif_arrival
 !action: The submersible surfaces amid clattering reef machinery.
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Hold trim at ten degrees. Let the reef breathe around us."
 "No sudden thrust—these relic gears are older than nations."
 !action: A spray of rusted brine mists the deck.
::end: {{ arrival }}
::scene: workshop
@title: The Tinker's Workshop
!sfx: gear_clicks, tiny_hammer
!music: ticking_lullaby
!vfx: ember_sparks
 !action: Lantern light dances across brass limb prototypes.
 [[ TINKER JAS ]] 
 "Three more rotations and the regulator aligns."
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Make it two. Storm windows are narrowing."
::end: {{ workshop }}
::end: {{ arc1_awakening_atoll }}
